        "kind": "invitation",
        "title": "Pause to watch and listen outside",
        "summary": "During time outdoors, pause over the leaves, birds or passing life your baby notices. A few names and some quiet can be enough.",
        "cue": "Something outside holds their gaze or makes them turn to listen.",
        "detail": [
          "The authors describe the movement of leaves and the sounds of birds as things a baby can enjoy. We can name a tree, dog or vehicle, then leave room to look and listen together."
